#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Aither R7 measurement framework: evidence-ID simulator + router + JSON final + evidence scoring.

Fixes R6 confounders:
- evidence IDs (not substring) for evidence discovery/causal/scoring;
- structured world state, semantic tool dispatch (no exact command strings);
- router P0/P1/P2 independent of answer key (P0 derives groups from prompt text only);
- final synthesis ALWAYS run (F0 thinking off / F1 thinking on), machine-readable JSON schema;
- field-level scoring (root cause / evidence / causal / remediation / schema).

Subcommands:
  simtest <scenarios.json>                    -> simulator contract test (evidence reachability)
  route   <scenarios.json> <p0|p1|p2> <base> <model> <key> [out_csv]  -> router A/B
  run     <scenarios.json> <full|routed> <f0|f1> <base> <model> <key> [out_csv]
"""
